The host reads Atmosphère-format cheat files for the running game's build
(dm/host/hle_cheats.c), keeps the player's toggles beside them, and
scripts/cheat_anchor.py carries a cheat file across game updates. Includes
the Cheats section of docs/frontends.md, the file contract for front ends.
Ported onto the pinned tree from seedds/nxnative#406 (all but the Mac panel).

Upstream-Status: forwarded seedds/nxnative#406
Reason: the launcher's cheat manager builds on its file contract until upstream merges it
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#97
